ARCHIVE MATERIAL
================

The architecture documentation under docs/ is condensed and adapted from the
documentation of the archived Runne runtime:

  Runne archive (SourceCraft)
  https://sourcecraft.dev/ryltsevmg/runne
  License: MIT
  Copyright (c) 2026 RUNNE Runtime contributors

The archived documentation described an earlier design: a Rust runtime and
clients with a Tauri desktop host. RunneTS is its own runtime, not a port of
that implementation: the archive informs intended behavior and provenance only.
The archived documents were translated into English, condensed and mapped onto
this repository; the adaptation is not a verbatim copy. No Rust source code from
the archive is included in RunneTS, and this repository contains no Rust code.
The desktop application is a separate project and is not built or shipped here.

The archive is reference material only. Where its documents disagree with this
repository's code, the code is authoritative.


